            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twicilani likongwa lyangu nipo mlijiganye kwa une, pakuti ndili jwakutulala mtima ni jwakulinandiya; naga mkutenda yingumsalilayi, timcisimana cipumulisi ca umi wenu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
